{
  "format": 1,
  "profile": "scene",
  "title": "Two hundred boxes under an orbiting camera",
  "description": "Two test agents' document: 200 one-metre boxes in a 20 by 10 grid on a ground plane under a perspective camera that orbits once in 5 s, a beacon 1.5 m above box-02-01 for measuring, and in a writer layer of its own a 2D label anchored there.",
